  "prefLabel": "Pos 1000 DEGREE-GRANTING POSTSECONDARY INSTITUTIONS WITH A PHYSICAL PRESENCE, OR PLACE OF CONTACT THAT CONDUCT ADVISING/MENTORING OR INSTRUCTION IN NEW HAMPSHIRE - REPEA",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Pos 1000 DEGREE-GRANTING POSTSECONDARY INSTITUTIONS WITH A PHYSICAL PRESENCE, OR PLACE OF CONTACT THAT CONDUCT ADVISING/MENTORING OR INSTRUCTION IN NEW HAMPSHIRE - REPEALED\n\nRevision Note:\n\nDocument #6398, effective 12-16-96, readopted with amendments Chapters Pos 200 through Pos 700 and adopted Chapters Pos 800 and Pos 900. Document #6398 also readopted with amendments and renumbered Chapters Pos 1300 and Pos 1400 as Chapters Pos 1000 and Pos 1100, respectively, with the exception of rule Pos 1305.03.\n\nRule Pos 1305.03 entitled \"Closed Courses\" was not readopted or repealed by Document #6398 but remained in effect and was editorially renumbered as rule Pos 1005.03. This rule was last filed under Document #5187, effective 7-23-91, and will therefore expire on 7-23-97 unless it is readopted, amended, or superseded before that.\n\nWith the exception of rule Pos 1005.03, Document #6398 supersedes all prior filings for the rules in former Chapters Pos 1300 and Pos 1400. The prior filings affecting these former Chapters include the following documents:\n\n#2291-a(E), effective 1-4-83 - Emergency Rule\n\n#2353, eff 4-27-83\n\n#2763, effective 6-21-84 (only Pos 1400)\n\n#3003, effective 4-23-85 (only Pos 1300)\n\n#3036, effective 6-17-85\n\n#5026, effective 12-19-90 (only Pos 1300)\n\n#5187, effective 7-23-91 (only Pos 1300)\n\n#5189, effective 7-23-91 (only Pos 1400)\n\n#5805, effective 3-29-94 (only Pos 1400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pos100-1700.html"
}
